{"candidateAnswer":"Mid-February 2023, just a few days after Valentine's Day.","evidence":"[D8:1 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Hey John, I haven't talked to you in a while. Last week, my grandma passed away and it's been really hard. I'm trying to stay positive, but it's tough. How're you doing?","itemId":"urn:uuid:ab501e48-d9fc-5602-85a2-0924b9b93f00","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2be2aa6a44bbcb6bde1907b4f3966a45d4ccfa6d63f7da121458a056cb9c1cab","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Maria's grandmother pass away?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 6 March 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2be2aa6a44bbcb6bde1907b4f3966a45d4ccfa6d63f7da121458a056cb9c1cab"}}]}